# Software industry mapping for OMS
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/oms/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:entitlement_order owl:equivalentClass sw:EntitlementOrder .
legacy:entitlement_order_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:entitlementOrderId .
legacy:license_fulfilment owl:equivalentClass sw:LicenseFulfilment .
legacy:license_fulfilment_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:licenseFulfilmentId .
legacy:fulfils_entitlement_order rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:fulfilsEntitlementOrder .
